{"task_id": "HumanEval/65", "solution": "def _get_digits_as_string(x: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Converts an integer to its string representation.\n    \"\"\"\n    return str(x)\ndef _reverse_digits(digits_str: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Reverses the order of characters in a string.\n    \"\"\"\n    return digits_str[::-1]\ndef _perform_circular_shift(digits_str: str, shift: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Performs a circular right shift on a string of digits.\n    \"\"\"\n    num_digits = len(digits_str)\n    actual_shift = shift % num_digits\n    if actual_shift == 0:\n        return digits_str\n    return digits_str[num_digits - actual_shift:] + digits_str[:num_digits - actual_shift]\ndef circular_shift(x, shift):\n    \"\"\"Circular shifts digits of x right by shift, or reverses if shift is too large.\n    Returns the result as a string.\n    \"\"\"\n    digits_str = _get_digits_as_string(x)\n    num_digits = len(digits_str)\n\n    if shift > num_digits:\n        return _reverse_digits(digits_str)\n    else:\n        return _perform_circular_shift(digits_str, shift)"}
